---
title: Outbox approach (confirmation emails)
---
flowchart TB
    A[API]
    H[PlaceOrderRequestHandler]
    D(dbOrder)
    O[OrderPlacedOutboxMessageHandler<br/>BackgroundService, one per instance]
    C{Claim saved?<br/>LockToken unchanged}
    E[IEmailSender<br/>MailKit, stable Message-ID per order]
    M(SMTP / Mailpit)
    S[Skip: another instance<br/>holds the message]

    A -->|Handle request| H
    H -->|Store payment outcome and OrderPlaced row<br/>in one transaction| D
    O -->|1. Poll ids: unprocessed, attempts left,<br/>no live lease| D
    O -->|2. Per message: set LockedUntil + new LockToken| C
    C -->|concurrency conflict| S
    C -->|yes| E
    E -->|Retry 4xx / connection errors with back-off| M
    O -->|3. Save per message - Success: ProcessedDate<br/>Failure: Attempts + 1, LastError; lease released| D
